Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:22.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.29,0:00:54.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gritos a lo lejos]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[jadea]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:15.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[tose]
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.04,0:01:26.96,中文,,0,0,0,,《百年孤独》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:29.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de gallo]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:35.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.12,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.29,0:02:01.29,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:01.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡José Arcadio!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.92,0:02:04.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在造什么 但我们得谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:04.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No sé en qué invento andas ahora, pero tenemos que hablar.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我在设计一个太阳能武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estoy desarrollando un arma solar.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.17,0:02:12.42,中文,,0,0,0,,-一个什么？-一种利用阳光来攻击的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:10.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Una qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:13.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Un arma solar que funciona con la luz. Mira el diseño.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.62,中文,,0,0,0,,你看这个设计
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.79,0:02:16.62,中文,,0,0,0,,它不需要火药 乌苏拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:16.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No necesita pólvora, Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.17,0:02:18.75,中文,,0,0,0,,真是天才般的设想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:18.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es una idea magnífica.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.83,0:02:21.50,中文,,0,0,0,,-哪里天才了？-任何军队都会想要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:21.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Magnífica para quién? - Para cualquier ejército.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.54,中文,,0,0,0,,只要做出能正常运作的样品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Si logro hacer un modelo funcional,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.75,0:02:26.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我就可以拿去卖给政府
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:26.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,podría vendérselo al gobierno.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.00,0:02:30.67,中文,,0,0,0,,但愿你哪天真能把这些只有你自己能听懂的天才设想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:28.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ojalá algún día, de verdad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,puedas vender una de esas ideas geniales
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.71,中文,,0,0,0,,卖出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que solo tú entiendes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:38.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[puerta se cierra]
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.54,0:02:43.12,中文,,0,0,0,,昔日简朴的村庄已然发展成活跃的小镇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:40.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:43.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,se convirtió en esos años en un pueblo activo,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.62,中文,,0,0,0,,镇上有了店铺和手工作坊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,con tiendas y talleres de artesanías,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.83,0:02:49.88,中文,,0,0,0,,有朝一日还会迎来穿尖头靴戴耳环的阿拉伯人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:49.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,donde algún día llegarían árabes de pantuflas y argollas en las orejas.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.62,中文,,0,0,0,,-马蒂尔德！-来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¡Matilde! - [Matilde] ¡Ahí voy!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.58,0:02:54.75,中文,,0,0,0,,-早上好-你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:55.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Buenas. - Hola.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.33,0:02:56.50,中文,,0,0,0,,衣裤改好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:56.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ya están listos.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.29,0:02:59.75,中文,,0,0,0,,这些应该够他再穿一年了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:02:58.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Creo que les alcanza un año más.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:02.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero eso sí, dile a José Arcadio que deje esa maña de crecer tanto.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.83,0:03:02.33,中文,,0,0,0,,但你快叫何塞·阿卡蒂奥别再长这么快了
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.58,0:03:04.42,中文,,0,0,0,,给你钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:04.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mira.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[tintineo de monedas]
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.79,中文,,0,0,0,,拜托 别跟我客气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No, hombre. No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.71,0:03:13.62,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:13.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.50,中文,,0,0,0,,我给你和孩子们带了糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:18.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Te traje más dulces para ti y los niños. - Ay, gracias. Déjamelos ahí.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.29,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢！放去那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:22.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mmm… Oye, es que te quedan sabrosos.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.38,0:03:22.38,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 你做的糖果很好吃
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.00,0:03:25.25,中文,,0,0,0,,真的 乌苏拉 你该拿去卖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:25.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hazme caso, Úrsula. Deberías venderlos.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.21,中文,,0,0,0,,马蒂尔德 我要忙的事已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ay, Matilde. Con todo lo que tengo que hacer.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.83,0:03:29.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你考虑一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:29.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Échale cabeza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:40.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suenan tambores]
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.92,0:03:46.04,中文,,0,0,0,,三月里 吉普赛人回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:46.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suena música animada]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[bullicio]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.92,0:04:25.92,中文,,0,0,0,,妙极了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:26.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Melquíades] Fascinante.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你是个真正的发明家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Eres un auténtico inventor.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.17,0:04:33.08,中文,,0,0,0,,我以为再也见不到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:33.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pensé que más nunca te iba a ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.04,中文,,0,0,0,,世界很大 何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,El mundo es grande, José Arcadio…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.29,0:04:40.29,中文,,0,0,0,,游历世界需要时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:40.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y toma su tiempo recorrerlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.92,0:04:44.08,中文,,0,0,0,,相信我 我已经计划好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:44.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Créeme, entre mis planes,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.42,0:04:46.83,中文,,0,0,0,,一定会再来见你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:46.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,estaba volver a verte.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.25,中文,,0,0,0,,快让我看看吧 教教我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero muéstrame. Enséñame.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.83,0:04:56.42,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉不让我在孩子们面前提这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:56.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Úrsula no quiere que diga esto frente a los niños…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.25,中文,,0,0,0,,但我得出了一个结论
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero llegué a la conclusión
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.54,0:05:04.00,中文,,0,0,0,,世界是圆的 就像这颗橘子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:04.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de que la Tierra es redonda como una naranja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.42,中文,,0,0,0,,你也觉得我疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿También crees que estoy loco?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.71,中文,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反 我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Al contrario, amigo mío.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.83,中文,,0,0,0,,我一直都知道你很有悟性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Siempre supe que eras un verdadero iluminado.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.79,0:05:24.38,中文,,0,0,0,,所以我给你带了些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:24.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Por eso he traído algo para ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:26.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música inquietante]
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.92,0:05:28.79,中文,,0,0,0,,为表钦佩之情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:28.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] de su admiración,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.17,0:05:34.21,中文,,0,0,0,,那天中午 梅贾德斯送了一件礼物给何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:34.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,ese mediodía, Melquíades le hizo un regalo a José Arcadio Buendía
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.29,0:05:39.46,中文,,0,0,0,,这件礼物将对马孔多的未来产生深远的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que había de ejercer una influencia terminante
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en el futuro de la aldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.96,0:05:49.58,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺！告诉你爸爸我要去市集了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:47.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Aureliano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Dile a tu papá que voy para el mercado!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.54,0:06:00.50,中文,,0,0,0,,-爸 妈妈让我来告诉…-出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:00.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Papá. Mi mamá mandó a decir… - ¡Afuera!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.96,0:06:09.92,中文,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:09.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y todo esto?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.79,0:06:13.04,中文,,0,0,0,,这个？这是炼金术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:13.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Melquíades] ¿Esto? Esto es alquimia.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.71,中文,,0,0,0,,-炼金术？-历史上最古老的科学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Alquimia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:17.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Melquíades] La ciencia más antigua de la historia.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.88,0:06:23.17,中文,,0,0,0,,我们来布置一个实验室好让你用各种元素做实验
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:20.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vamos a montar un laboratorio
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:23.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para que puedas experimentar con los elementos.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.96,0:06:25.96,中文,,0,0,0,,什么元素？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:25.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué elementos?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.75,0:06:29.88,中文,,0,0,0,,构成这个世界的各种物质
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:29.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Los que componen la materia del mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.50,0:06:33.54,中文,,0,0,0,,氨、铅、水银
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:32.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Amoníaco. Plomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:33.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mercurio.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.38,中文,,0,0,0,,硫磺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Azufre.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.88,0:06:40.54,中文,,0,0,0,,炼金术 我的朋友即为对物质的掌控之术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La alquimia, amigo mío,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:40.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,es el dominio de la materia,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.42,0:06:46.08,中文,,0,0,0,,是人类所能驾驭的最辉煌、最宏伟的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:43.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y el poder más espléndido y grandioso
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,al que el ser humano puede acceder.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.96,0:06:49.00,中文,,0,0,0,,能超然于此的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:49.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Después de esto…
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.79,0:06:50.96,中文,,0,0,0,,唯有上帝而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:50.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,solo Dios.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ambos ríen]
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.88,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio] ¡Aureliano!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.79,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Aureliano, ven acá!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.04,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Aureliano, ven!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música animada]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:11.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[rugido del mar]
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.79,0:07:16.42,中文,,0,0,0,,在何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚醉心于炼金术之际
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.79,0:07:16.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] se sumía en la alquimia,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.67,0:07:21.67,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉创建了绝妙的糖果小动物生意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:21.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Úrsula emprendió su maravillosa industria de animalitos de caramelo,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.50,0:07:26.54,中文,,0,0,0,,她将糖果串在巴沙木上一天分两次售卖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:26.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que dos veces al día salían de la casa insertados en palos de balso.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:31.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música animada continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.62,0:07:43.88,中文,,0,0,0,,把介绍口味的牌子立起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:43.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,El cartel de degustación.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.12,中文,,0,0,0,,卖糖果喽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Caramelos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] A ver si a la gente le gusta.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.58,0:07:50.46,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 何塞·阿卡蒂奥在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:50.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Oye. ¿Y José Arcadio dónde está?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:52.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música cesa]
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.04,0:08:05.46,中文,,0,0,0,,自马孔多创建以来便认识何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:02.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] a José Arcadio Buendía
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.79,0:08:05.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,desde los tiempos de la fundación de Macondo
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.00,0:08:10.25,中文,,0,0,0,,震惊于他的改变和梅贾德斯那强大的影响力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:10.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,se asombraban de cuánto había cambiado bajo la influencia de Melquíades.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.33,0:08:15.08,中文,,0,0,0,,每一位炼金术士都致力于解开物质的奥秘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:15.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La misión del alquimista es descifrar los misterios de la materia,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.17,0:08:17.54,中文,,0,0,0,,而对其技术最强有力的证明…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.17,0:08:17.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y la prueba más grande de su dominio…
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.33,0:08:20.83,中文,,0,0,0,,是点石成金
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:20.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,es la transformación
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.79,中文,,0,0,0,,也就是将贱金属…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de los metales innobles…
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.42,中文,,0,0,0,,炼制成黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en oro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:29.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.88,中文,,0,0,0,,那根本不可能 梅贾德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Eso no es posible, Melquíades.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.21,中文,,0,0,0,,真那么容易的话人人都会窝在家里炼金了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Si fuera tan fácil, todo el mundo andaría haciendo oro en sus casas.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.21,中文,,0,0,0,,有可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Sí es posible.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.50,中文,,0,0,0,,对炼金术士来说有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Para un alquimista sí es posible.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.58,0:08:46.42,中文,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:46.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mira.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.62,0:08:51.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这需要大量的技巧和练习
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:51.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Requiere mucho estudio y práctica,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.29,0:08:55.83,中文,,0,0,0,,所以我建议你继续从更简单的操作开始学起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:55.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,así que yo te aconsejo continuar con algo más sencillo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.54,0:09:02.79,中文,,0,0,0,,（转化金属 复制黄金）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:03.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de grillos]
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.00,0:09:07.21,中文,,0,0,0,,…因为我真的对复制黄金很感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:07.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…porque esto de doblar el oro me ha llamado bastante la atención.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:09.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Úrsula. Melquíades se queda a comer.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.92,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉 梅贾德斯今晚留下吃饭
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.25,0:09:14.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你们随便吃吧 晚饭就是这些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:14.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Lo que puedan. Lo que ven es lo que hay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.71,0:09:18.33,中文,,0,0,0,,不用了 真的 谢谢 但我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:18.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No se preocupe, de verdad. Gracias. Me tengo que marchar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.33,中文,,0,0,0,,族人还在营地等我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me esperan en el campamento.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.83,0:09:21.71,中文,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:21.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Señora.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.92,中文,,0,0,0,,梅贾德斯 今晚我就开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Melquíades, esta misma noche me voy a poner…
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.33,0:09:32.21,中文,,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:32.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Te veo mañana.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.75,中文,,0,0,0,,那恐怕不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me temo que no va a poder ser.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.25,0:09:36.96,中文,,0,0,0,,我们正在收拾行装
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:36.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estamos recogiendo nuestras cosas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.46,0:09:38.71,中文,,0,0,0,,明早天一亮就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:38.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Salimos de madrugada.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.21,0:09:41.42,中文,,0,0,0,,可我们的实验才刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:41.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero si acabamos de empezar los experimentos.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.92,0:09:45.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道 但所有设备都齐全了你可以继续实验
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:42.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Lo sé,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:45.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero tienes todo lo que te hace falta para continuar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你并不需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No me necesitas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.79,中文,,0,0,0,,不过别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero tranquilo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.33,0:09:54.88,中文,,0,0,0,,我保证一定会回来的 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:54.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Te prometo que volveré, amigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你邀请朋友来之前得先问问家里有什么可招待客人的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Cuando quieras invitar a tu amigo, pregunta primero si hay algo para darle.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.12,中文,,0,0,0,,成天就闷在作坊里 活在自己的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Encerrado en ese cuartucho no te enteras de nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.54,0:10:18.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你要知道 那是炼金实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:18.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Para que sepas, es un laboratorio de alquimia.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.79,0:10:20.17,中文,,0,0,0,,而且我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:20.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y sabes una cosa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.54,中文,,0,0,0,,它会让我们变富有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Nos va a volver ricos.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你该醒醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ya era hora,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我爸留下的遗产快花光了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,porque se está acabando la herencia de mi papá.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.08,0:10:39.42,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚别再被那个吉普赛人洗脑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:39.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía, sácate esas ideas de gitano de la cabeza,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我们有一大家子人要养活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que tenemos una familia que alimentar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.00,0:10:55.29,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥！奥雷里亚诺！吃早餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:55.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡José Arcadio, Aureliano! A desayunar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.67,0:10:59.88,中文,,0,0,0,,你看见孩子们了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:10:59.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Has visto a los niños?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.71,0:11:03.58,中文,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.71,0:11:03.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:23.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música de acción]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:28.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[jadean]
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.12,0:11:31.54,中文,,0,0,0,,它往那边跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:31.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Va por allá! ¡Por allá!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:33.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gruñidos]
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.54,0:11:43.00,中文,,0,0,0,,去那边 奥雷里亚诺！快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:43.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Corre por allá, Aureliano! ¡Corre, corre!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:45.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [chillido] - [grita]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:48.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[cuchillazo]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[grita]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:54.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gotas caen]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:11:59.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gruñido]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:10.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sentimental]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gritan]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:38.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.42,0:12:43.54,中文,,0,0,0,,皮拉 你看见我家孩子了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:43.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pilar. ¿Viste a mis hijos?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.17,0:12:48.25,中文,,0,0,0,,他们一早就出门了 现在还没回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.17,0:12:48.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Salieron en la madrugada y no han vuelto.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.92,中文,,0,0,0,,他们肯定就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ellos deben andar por ahí.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.12,0:12:55.29,中文,,0,0,0,,别担心 既然来了我给你占卜一下吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:53.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:55.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Por qué no aprovechas y te leo las cartas?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.33,0:13:08.38,中文,,0,0,0,,想问什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:08.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pregunta.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.42,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.71,0:13:13.54,中文,,0,0,0,,抽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:13.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] Saca.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:22.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.62,0:13:27.58,中文,,0,0,0,,他看世界的方式不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:27.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tu marido ve el mundo diferente.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.62,中文,,0,0,0,,他是一个充满激情和执念的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es un hombre de pasiones y obsesiones,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.12,0:13:37.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你应该庆幸他执迷的不是女人或者其他恶习
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:37.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero debes agradecer que no son ni las mujeres ni los vicios,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,sino viviría zampado en la tienda de Catarino.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.96,0:13:40.17,中文,,0,0,0,,否则就会整天在卡塔里诺的酒吧买醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio y Aureliano ríen]
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.38,0:13:45.71,中文,,0,0,0,,看我怎么骂他们我们回头再聊 谢啦 皮拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:45.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estos muchachitos me van a oír. Terminamos después. Gracias, Pilar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.92,0:13:48.88,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:50.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡José Arcadio! ¡Aureliano!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.38,0:13:50.21,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺！
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.79,0:14:01.54,中文,,0,0,0,,（转化金属 复制黄金）
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.04,0:14:16.75,中文,,0,0,0,,两个小兔崽子回来了你肯定猜不到他们带回了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:16.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aparecieron los niños y no te imaginas lo que trajeron.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你不会胆敢把金币拿走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Dime que no te atreviste a coger las monedas.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.00,中文,,0,0,0,,金币呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Dónde están?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.58,0:14:25.29,中文,,0,0,0,,我明明是按照公式一步步来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:25.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Seguí la fórmula paso a paso.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.33,中文,,0,0,0,,什么公式？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué fórmula?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.29,0:14:30.58,中文,,0,0,0,,一个复制黄金的科学方法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.29,0:14:30.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es un proceso científico para doblar el oro.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.21,0:14:34.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你觉得那坨东西像黄金吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:34.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿A ti te parece que ese amasijo se ve como oro?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.50,0:14:37.29,中文,,0,0,0,,或许我能把黄金分离出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:37.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tal vez podría separarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:40.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tendría que usar un poco más de azufre, menos plomo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.67,0:14:40.46,中文,,0,0,0,,我得多加点硫磺 少用些铅
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.54,0:14:43.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你居然不跟我说一声就把钱拿走？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:43.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo pudiste hacerlo sin preguntármelo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:46.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estoy utilizando esas monedas para el negocio de caramelo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.25,0:14:46.12,中文,,0,0,0,,那些金币是我要用来开办糖果生意的
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.46,中文,,0,0,0,,什么生意？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Cuál negocio?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你非但不为这个家出一份力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No solo no haces nada por esta casa,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:56.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,sino que tienes el descaro de acabar con lo poco que nos queda.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.17,0:14:56.00,中文,,0,0,0,,还竟敢毁了我们仅剩的一点资金
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.12,0:15:00.58,中文,,0,0,0,,我会把所有黄金都炼制回来分毫不差
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:00.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo voy a recuperar cada gramo de oro.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.50,0:15:02.38,中文,,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:02.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Te lo juro.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.08,0:15:07.42,中文,,0,0,0,,不 我不需要你炼制黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:04.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No necesito que recuperes el oro.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.12,0:15:10.50,中文,,0,0,0,,我需要你照顾家人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:10.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Necesito que te hagas cargo de tu familia,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.58,0:15:13.25,中文,,0,0,0,,照看孩子们 你整天对他们不管不顾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:13.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de tus hijos, que están abandonados a la buena de Dios.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.33,0:15:15.04,中文,,0,0,0,,他们都快成野人了 你自己看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:15.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Van como salvajes, míralos.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.33,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.33,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aureliano.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.25,中文,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vengan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.88,0:15:50.83,中文,,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:50.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Entren.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:08.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música de misterio]
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.17,中文,,0,0,0,,自那晚以后
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:10.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] José Arcadio Buendía
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.25,0:16:12.29,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚把宝贵的时间都留给了孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:12.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,les dedicó sus horas mejores.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.42,0:16:16.08,中文,,0,0,0,,-他教他们读书写字-耐心点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:16.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Les enseñó a leer y a escribir… - ¡Paciencia, amigo!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.75,0:16:19.75,中文,,0,0,0,,-向他们讲解这世上的诸多奇迹…-我抓到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:18.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…y les habló de las maravillas del mundo…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:19.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Agarré uno!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.83,0:16:23.67,中文,,0,0,0,,…拓宽他们思维的界限把想象力发挥到不可思议的极致
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:23.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…forzando a extremos increíbles los límites de su imaginación.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.17,0:16:27.29,中文,,0,0,0,,男孩们就这样得知
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:28.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Fue así cómo los niños terminaron por aprender que era posible
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.92,中文,,0,0,0,,其实人可以徒步穿越爱琴海…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,atravesar a pie el mar Egeo,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.00,0:16:30.96,中文,,0,0,0,,…在非洲的南部…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:34.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,saltando de isla en isla hasta el puerto de Salónica.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.04,0:16:34.17,中文,,0,0,0,,…只需从一个岛屿跳上另一个直至抵达塞萨洛尼基港
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:37.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B.] …su entretenimiento era sentarse a pensar.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.50,0:16:37.21,中文,,0,0,0,,…静坐沉思是他们唯一的消遣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[chirrido de insectos]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de gallo]
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.29,0:16:54.50,中文,,0,0,0,,想都不要想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:54.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Deja la necedad.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.17,0:16:57.00,中文,,0,0,0,,这些可以拿去卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.17,0:16:57.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estos ya están listos para la venta.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.17,中文,,0,0,0,,我去叫何塞·阿卡蒂奥做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Le voy a decir a José Arcadio que se aliste.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.46,中文,,0,0,0,,别想偷吃 我数过了的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] Están contados, por si piensas hacer alguna diablura.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.58,0:17:17.04,中文,,0,0,0,,一天早晨 乌苏拉走进房间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:17.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] Úrsula entró en el cuarto
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.92,0:17:21.79,中文,,0,0,0,,看见儿子的裸体一股令人困惑的羞赧感油然而生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:21.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y experimentó un confuso sentimiento de vergüenza al ver a su hijo,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.58,0:17:25.83,中文,,0,0,0,,他俨然为生活做好了在她看来过于充分的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:25.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,tan bien equipado para la vida que le pareció anormal.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.75,中文,,0,0,0,,那让她重温了新婚时的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y vivió de nuevo sus terrores de recién casada.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你这是什么表情？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y esa cara?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.75,0:17:35.50,中文,,0,0,0,,活像看见了普鲁丹修·阿圭拉的鬼魂似的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:35.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Parece que hubieras visto el fantasma de Prudencio Aguilar.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.75,0:17:40.58,中文,,0,0,0,,-我看见了更糟的东西-还有什么能比那更糟？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:38.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vi algo peor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:40.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué puede ser peor que eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.54,0:17:43.79,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:43.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.38,0:17:46.50,中文,,0,0,0,,-我刚才看到了他的裸体-所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:46.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Lo acabo de ver desnudo. - ¿Y?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.12,中文,,0,0,0,,他的阴茎大得出奇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tiene un miembro descomunal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar ríe a carcajadas]
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.29,0:17:54.71,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉 这很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:57.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es normal, Úrsula. Está creciendo. Todo se le desarrolla al mismo tiempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.79,0:17:57.08,中文,,0,0,0,,他在长身体呀全身上下都会一起长大
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.08,中文,,0,0,0,,一点也不正常 皮拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula] No es normal, Pilar.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.00,0:18:01.67,中文,,0,0,0,,那东西都大得畸形了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:01.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Parece una malformación.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.50,中文,,0,0,0,,比猪尾巴还糟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es peor que una cola de cerdo.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.54,0:18:09.42,中文,,0,0,0,,他可能因我而受了诅咒注定要孤独一生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:09.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Puede ser que lo condené a estar solo el resto de su vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.92,0:18:10.92,中文,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:10.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Al contrario.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.58,0:18:12.67,中文,,0,0,0,,他会很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:12.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Él va a ser feliz.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.96,0:18:17.79,中文,,0,0,0,,但我可以给他推算未来如果这样能让你安心点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:17.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero si te da tranquilidad, yo le puedo leer el porvenir.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.17,中文,,0,0,0,,好啊 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:27.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ventisca]
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.08,0:18:27.96,中文,,0,0,0,,切牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:27.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Corta.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.71,0:18:41.83,中文,,0,0,0,,放松点 何塞·阿卡蒂奥我又不会弄疼你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:41.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tranquilo, José Arcadio, que esto no duele.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.71,0:18:43.58,中文,,0,0,0,,抽三张牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:43.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Saca tres.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.08,中文,,0,0,0,,这三张牌是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué dice?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.12,0:19:01.25,中文,,0,0,0,,你会如狂风般百折不挠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:01.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Que vas a ser indomable, como un vendaval.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[vendaval]
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.38,中文,,0,0,0,,好家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Qué bárbaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.12,0:19:21.88,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥感觉浑身的骨头仿佛充满了泡沫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:21.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] que los huesos se le llenaban de espuma
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.17,0:19:27.21,中文,,0,0,0,,他感到一种酥软无力的恐惧和泫然欲泣的渴望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:27.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y experimentó un miedo lánguido, y unos terribles deseos de llorar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:29.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[puerta se abre]
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.17,0:19:32.75,中文,,0,0,0,,卡牌怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:32.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Bueno, ¿y qué dicen las cartas?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.88,中文,,0,0,0,,他不会为女人或者后代所苦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Que no va a sufrir por mujer ni descendencia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:39.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[relincho]
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.12,0:19:41.12,中文,,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:41.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Te lo aseguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de grillos]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ulular de búho]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:19:58.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[jadea]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:20.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música de intriga]
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.08,中文,,0,0,0,,在那辗转难眠的可怕夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] en el espanto de la vigilia,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.96,0:20:27.50,中文,,0,0,0,,他又一次急不可耐地渴求着皮拉·特内拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:27.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,volvió a desear a Pilar Ternera con una ansiedad brutal.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.83,0:20:33.29,中文,,0,0,0,,他想和她在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:33.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Quería estar con ella…
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.04,0:20:39.00,中文,,0,0,0,,和她一直待在那谷仓里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:39.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que nunca salieran del granero,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.58,中文,,0,0,0,,让她惊呼：“好家伙！”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y que le dijera: "¡Qué bárbaro!".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [crujido de la puerta] - [ronquidos]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:55.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[golpe]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ronquidos continúan]
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.21,0:21:04.62,中文,,0,0,0,,星期三…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:04.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[chico] Miércoles…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:09.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ronquidos continúan]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:24.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música dramática]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:15.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gimen]
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.92,0:22:45.58,中文,,0,0,0,,皮拉·特内拉让他明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:45.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] le había permitido entender
Dialogue: 10,0:22:46.25,0:22:48.71,中文,,0,0,0,,男人因何会惧怕死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.25,0:22:48.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,por qué los hombres le tienen miedo a la muerte.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.21,0:22:53.46,中文,,0,0,0,,-早上好-早上好 都有些什么口味？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:53.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Buenos días. - ¿Qué sabores tiene?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.54,0:22:56.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Tamarindo, corozo, limón y naranja. - Deme naranja y corozo.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.62,0:22:56.62,中文,,0,0,0,,-罗望子、象牙果、酸橙和橘子-我要一个橘子味和一个象牙果味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:22:57.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.83,0:22:57.75,中文,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.83,0:22:59.08,中文,,0,0,0,,-亲爱的！-皮拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.83,0:22:59.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] ¡Oh, comadre!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.17,0:23:00.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Pilar!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.25,0:23:01.42,中文,,0,0,0,,生意好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.25,0:23:01.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Está buena la venta?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.50,0:23:03.00,中文,,0,0,0,,都快忙不过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:03.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tanto que no damos abasto.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.00,0:23:05.17,中文,,0,0,0,,帮我看一会儿孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:06.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Quédate con los niños, voy por más caramelos.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.25,0:23:07.58,中文,,0,0,0,,-我回家再拿点糖果来-好 你去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:07.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Bueno, dale, dale.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.50,中文,,0,0,0,,-酸橙和象牙果味的 谢谢-你拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Dame uno de limón y corozo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:10.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] Cógelo.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.83,0:23:14.58,中文,,0,0,0,,-给我来个橘子味的-橘子味的很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.83,0:23:14.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [hombre] Uno de naranja. - El de naranja está sabroso.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:16.46,0:23:19.46,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥 把糖果给我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:19.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio. Pásame los dulces.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.00,0:23:46.42,中文,,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.00,0:23:46.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano] ¿Dónde estabas?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.92,0:23:54.96,中文,,0,0,0,,今晚不是你头一回偷溜出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:54.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No es la primera noche que te escapas.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.08,0:24:01.42,中文,,0,0,0,,不打算告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.08,0:24:01.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿No me vas a contar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.42,0:24:05.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano resopla]
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.75,0:24:07.92,中文,,0,0,0,,我去见了一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:07.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Conocí a una mujer.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.75,0:24:12.21,中文,,0,0,0,,一个女人？你见一个女人做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Una mujer?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.21,0:24:12.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Y qué hacías tú con una mujer? - [ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.79,0:24:14.50,中文,,0,0,0,,你应该问 她在跟我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.79,0:24:14.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Más bien, qué hacía ella conmigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.50,0:24:20.79,中文,,0,0,0,,她的身体散发着烟味
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.50,0:24:20.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tiene un cuerpo que huele a humo…
Dialogue: 10,0:24:29.17,0:24:31.42,中文,,0,0,0,,她爽朗的笑声足以吓跑鸽子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.17,0:24:31.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y una risa que espanta a las palomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.50,0:24:32.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ríe a carcajadas]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:34.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ventisca]
Dialogue: 10,0:24:34.25,0:24:35.75,中文,,0,0,0,,当她触碰我时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.25,0:24:35.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio] Cuando me toca,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.29,0:24:39.38,中文,,0,0,0,,感觉她比我更了解我的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.29,0:24:39.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,parece que conoce mi cuerpo mejor que yo mismo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.33,0:24:42.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar gime]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.42,0:24:43.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:24:44.00,0:24:47.46,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺你要是知道了舌头还能用来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:47.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No sabes todas las cosas que se pueden hacer con la lengua, Aureliano.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:48.58,0:24:49.79,中文,,0,0,0,,一定会很惊讶的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.58,0:24:49.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Te sorprenderías.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.38,0:24:54.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar gime]
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.62,0:24:59.04,中文,,0,0,0,,然后到某一刻 我们都登上了愉悦的顶峰 那感觉真是欲仙欲死
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.62,0:24:56.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y llega el momento
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.75,0:24:59.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en el que casi nos desmayamos del placer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:04.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar gime y grita]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.62,0:25:06.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[temblor]
Dialogue: 10,0:25:12.00,0:25:13.08,中文,,0,0,0,,那是什么样的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:13.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué se siente?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.54,0:25:17.38,中文,,0,0,0,,就像地震一样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:17.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es como un temblor de tierra.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.88,0:25:19.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ambos ríen]
Dialogue: 10,0:25:24.04,0:25:26.88,中文,,0,0,0,,阳光汇聚在玻璃片上
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.04,0:25:26.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B.] Los rayos solares convergen en el lente
Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.29,0:25:30.50,中文,,0,0,0,,被照射的目标就会开始燃烧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.29,0:25:30.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y los proyecta para poder quemar el objeto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.04,0:25:32.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.08,0:25:44.88,中文,,0,0,0,,只要把阳光聚焦于一点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.08,0:25:47.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Al estar concentrados en un solo punto, los rayos podrían quemar el objeto.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:45.46,0:25:47.62,中文,,0,0,0,,就能让目标燃烧
Dialogue: 10,0:26:10.42,0:26:12.04,中文,,0,0,0,,-成功了！-妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:12.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¡Eso! - ¡Mamá!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.21,0:26:14.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Ey!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.96,0:26:18.04,中文,,0,0,0,,你看见了吗 乌苏拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.96,0:26:19.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B.] ¿Lo viste, Úrsula? Lo logramos.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:18.54,0:26:19.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我们成功了
Dialogue: 10,0:26:21.00,0:26:21.88,中文,,0,0,0,,这法子真的管用
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.00,0:26:21.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Sí funciona.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.46,0:26:24.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [tambores] - [narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:26:24.29,0:26:25.67,中文,,0,0,0,,多年以后
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.83,0:26:28.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,antes de que un oficial diera la orden de fuego,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.21,0:26:28.71,中文,,0,0,0,,在军官向行刑队下令开枪的前一刻
Dialogue: 10,0:26:29.29,0:26:32.67,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺·布恩迪亚上校又回想起三月里那个温暖的午后
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.29,0:26:32.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,el coronel Aureliano Buendía volvió a vivir esa tarde de marzo
Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.75,0:26:35.04,中文,,0,0,0,,他的父亲在教学途中倏然顿住
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.75,0:26:35.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en que su padre interrumpió la lección
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.67,0:26:38.33,中文,,0,0,0,,凝神倾听着那代表吉普赛人回村的锣声
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.67,0:26:38.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,al oír que una vez más llegaban los gitanos a la aldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:38.79,0:26:39.79,中文,,0,0,0,,梅贾德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.79,0:26:39.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Melquíades.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:42.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suena música animada]
Dialogue: 10,0:27:08.96,0:27:11.54,中文,,0,0,0,,快来看呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.96,0:27:09.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[hombre] ¡Vengan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.67,0:27:11.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Vengan!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:12.38,0:27:13.42,中文,,0,0,0,,再靠近点！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.38,0:27:13.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Acérquense!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:14.08,0:27:18.00,中文,,0,0,0,,来看看孟菲斯圣贤们的最新发现
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.08,0:27:15.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Conozcan el último hallazgo
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.42,0:27:18.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de los sabios de Memphis!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:20.00,0:27:23.88,中文,,0,0,0,,这是属于所罗门王的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.00,0:27:23.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡La maravilla que perteneció al rey Salomón!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.46,0:27:29.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ah… Son 30 reales.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:28.38,0:27:29.79,中文,,0,0,0,,30雷亚尔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.79,0:27:49.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música de misterio]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.25,0:28:13.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] un aliento glacial.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:12.67,0:28:15.46,中文,,0,0,0,,箱子喷吐着冰冷的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.21,0:28:18.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Dentro había un enorme bloque transparente,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:16.42,0:28:19.00,中文,,0,0,0,,里面装着一个巨大的透明砖块
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.12,0:28:21.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,con infinitas agujas internas
Dialogue: 10,0:28:19.88,0:28:21.46,中文,,0,0,0,,内里蕴含无数针芒
Dialogue: 10,0:28:22.71,0:28:27.12,中文,,0,0,0,,薄暮的余晖落入其间便顷刻化作斑斓的星辰
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.71,0:28:27.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en las cuales se despedazaban estrellas de colores la claridad del crepúsculo.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:27.21,0:28:29.08,中文,,0,0,0,,世界上最大的钻石
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.21,0:28:29.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,El diamante más grande del mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:29.62,0:28:30.67,中文,,0,0,0,,不 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.62,0:28:30.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No, señor.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.33,0:28:32.54,中文,,0,0,0,,这是冰
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.33,0:28:32.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es hielo.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:40.33,0:28:42.96,中文,,0,0,0,,这真是当代最伟大的发明
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.33,0:28:42.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Es el gran invento de nuestro tiempo. - [niega]
Dialogue: 10,0:28:43.79,0:28:46.12,中文,,0,0,0,,摸一下要再付5雷亚尔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.79,0:28:46.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Son cinco reales más para poder tocarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.29,0:28:58.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música de misterio continúa]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:21.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:21.83,0:29:23.12,中文,,0,0,0,,烫得扎手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.83,0:29:23.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[susurra] Está hirviendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.62,0:29:25.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [hombre] ¡Ey! - [tambores]
Dialogue: 10,0:29:25.21,0:29:32.21,中文,,0,0,0,,（孟菲斯圣贤的伟大奇迹）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.17,0:29:30.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suena música animada]
Dialogue: 10,0:29:36.42,0:29:40.04,中文,,0,0,0,,来看苏美尔人隐藏了好几个世纪的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:40.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[hombre] Conozcan el poder de la receta sumeria
Dialogue: 10,0:29:40.54,0:29:43.58,中文,,0,0,0,,强大秘方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.54,0:29:43.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que permaneció oculta por siglos.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:43.62,0:29:49.00,中文,,0,0,0,,（著名的欧几里德）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:50.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,El jarabe
Dialogue: 10,0:29:49.08,0:29:50.46,中文,,0,0,0,,这种糖浆
Dialogue: 10,0:29:51.29,0:29:52.79,中文,,0,0,0,,能让人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.29,0:29:52.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para hacerse…
Dialogue: 10,0:29:53.54,0:29:55.00,中文,,0,0,0,,隐形
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.54,0:29:55.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,invisible.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.67,0:30:02.08,中文,,0,0,0,,不好意思 先生你认识梅贾德斯吗？那位炼金术士
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.67,0:30:00.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Permiso, señor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.25,0:30:02.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Conoce a Melquíades, el alquimista?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:02.17,0:30:03.67,中文,,0,0,0,,梅贾德斯死了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.17,0:30:03.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Melquíades murió
Dialogue: 10,0:30:04.62,0:30:06.50,中文,,0,0,0,,葬身在新加坡的沙洲上
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.62,0:30:06.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en los médanos de Singapur.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.67,0:30:09.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:30:10.58,0:30:13.12,中文,,0,0,0,,这不可能 梅贾德斯一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.58,0:30:11.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No puede ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.75,0:30:14.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Melquíades tiene que estar… - [exclamaciones]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:45.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música dramática]
Dialogue: 10,0:31:13.33,0:31:14.50,中文,,0,0,0,,梅贾德斯死了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.33,0:31:14.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Melquíades murió.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:41.75,0:31:45.25,中文,,0,0,0,,我能祭奠他的最好方式就是不让炼金术消亡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.75,0:31:45.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,El mejor homenaje que le puedo hacer es no dejar morir la alquimia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.46,0:31:56.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[líquido burbujea]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.21,0:32:08.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula gime]
Dialogue: 10,0:32:10.96,0:32:12.00,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.96,0:32:12.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.12,0:32:15.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gemidos continúan]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.42,0:32:28.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[jadea] José Arcadio…
Dialogue: 10,0:32:26.92,0:32:28.46,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.88,0:32:31.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [rompe bolsa] - [grita]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:50.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gemidos continúan]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.88,0:32:56.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[grita]
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.21,0:33:08.12,中文,,0,0,0,,一月里的一个星期四 凌晨两点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.21,0:33:08.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] a las dos de la madrugada,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.62,0:33:09.96,中文,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲出生了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.62,0:33:09.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,nació Amaranta.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:11.46,0:33:14.33,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉仔细检查了她
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.46,0:33:14.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Úrsula la examinó minuciosamente.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:15.38,0:33:18.12,中文,,0,0,0,,她很轻 身上湿漉漉的 像一只蝾螈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:18.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Era liviana y acuosa como una lagartija,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:19.42,0:33:21.54,中文,,0,0,0,,但浑身上下都是正常的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.42,0:33:21.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero todas sus partes eran humanas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.38,0:33:24.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula jadea]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.33,0:33:31.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:33:35.04,0:33:37.54,中文,,0,0,0,,-她真漂亮-你终于如愿以偿 有个女儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:37.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Ay, hermosa. - La niña que tanto querías.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.08,0:33:41.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No ha llorado desde que llegamos. Será una niña muy tranquila.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:38.67,0:33:41.17,中文,,0,0,0,,她还没哭过呢以后肯定是个娴静的姑娘
Dialogue: 10,0:33:41.25,0:33:43.79,中文,,0,0,0,,-是啊 恭喜-嘿 这个饼干真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.25,0:33:42.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Felicitaciones.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:45.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Esta galleta está buenísima. - De la tienda de Carmen.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:43.88,0:33:45.00,中文,,0,0,0,,是在卡门那儿买的
Dialogue: 10,0:33:45.08,0:33:45.96,中文,,0,0,0,,来尝尝面包吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.08,0:33:48.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero prueba el pan. Mira, este pan lo hice yo y es de miel.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:46.62,0:33:48.29,中文,,0,0,0,,这个蜂蜜面包是我自己做的
Dialogue: 10,0:33:49.17,0:33:50.67,中文,,0,0,0,,嘿 孩子她爸呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.17,0:33:50.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Oye, ¿y el compadre?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:51.79,0:33:53.38,中文,,0,0,0,,一定是在作坊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.79,0:33:53.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Debe estar trabajando en el taller.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:53.46,0:33:55.08,中文,,0,0,0,,-我想抱抱她-他一会儿就来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.46,0:33:55.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- La quiero cargar. - No demora en venir.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:56.04,0:33:58.88,中文,,0,0,0,,我们成功了！乌苏拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.04,0:33:57.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B.] ¡Sí, lo logramos!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.88,0:33:58.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Úrsula!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.96,0:34:00.58,中文,,0,0,0,,-妈妈！-乌苏拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.96,0:34:00.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [Aureliano] ¡Mamá! - ¡Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.67,0:34:01.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gritos]
Dialogue: 10,0:34:02.04,0:34:03.21,中文,,0,0,0,,家里来客人了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:03.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tenemos visitas.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:03.58,0:34:05.38,中文,,0,0,0,,山中之王来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.58,0:34:05.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Salió el tigre de la montaña!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:05.46,0:34:07.50,中文,,0,0,0,,是啊 因为他再待在山上就要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.46,0:34:07.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Sí, porque se iba muriendo allá adentro.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.58,0:34:10.21,中文,,0,0,0,,这位朋友 马尼费科、盖里奈多
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.58,0:34:10.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Comadre, Magnífico, Gerineldo.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:11.17,0:34:12.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你们看 这是金币
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.17,0:34:12.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Están viendo monedas de oro.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.88,0:34:16.04,中文,,0,0,0,,从合金里提炼出来的简直是不可能的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:16.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rescatadas de una aleación imposible.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:17.00,0:34:18.00,中文,,0,0,0,,是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.00,0:34:18.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Es en serio?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:18.08,0:34:18.96,中文,,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.08,0:34:18.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Así es.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你们不知道我有多开心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No saben la felicidad que me da.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:22.38,0:34:23.92,中文,,0,0,0,,-恭喜-那能买多少只山羊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.38,0:34:23.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Te felicito. - ¿Cuántos chivos son?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:24.00,0:34:25.25,中文,,0,0,0,,我们来谈生意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.00,0:34:26.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Sí, vamos a hacer negocio. [ríe] - Shh.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:26.62,0:34:28.42,中文,,0,0,0,,孩子 你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.62,0:34:28.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mijo, ¿qué te parece?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:28.83,0:34:30.12,中文,,0,0,0,,看起来像狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.83,0:34:30.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Parece mierda de perro.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.21,0:34:31.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[risas]
Dialogue: 10,0:34:31.83,0:34:32.71,中文,,0,0,0,,别胡说！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.83,0:34:32.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Respeta!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:43.67,0:34:44.58,中文,,0,0,0,,我们去庆祝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.67,0:34:44.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vamos a celebrar.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:45.04,0:34:46.71,中文,,0,0,0,,-对！-喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:46.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¡Sí! - Me voy a servir un trago.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:47.25,0:34:49.04,中文,,0,0,0,,-真漂亮-是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.25,0:34:49.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿La puedo alzar? - Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.12,0:34:51.17,中文,,0,0,0,,噢！你这小手真可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.12,0:34:51.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Matilde] ¡Qué linda manita!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:53.38,0:34:55.08,中文,,0,0,0,,进来吧 我的兄弟们不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.38,0:34:55.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Entra, que mis hermanos no están.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:57.42,0:35:00.88,中文,,0,0,0,,他羞辱我！他还把我当小男孩看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.42,0:34:58.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio] ¡Me humilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:35:00.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me sigue tratando como si fuera un niño.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:03.00,0:35:05.17,中文,,0,0,0,,别为那种愚蠢的小事激动了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:05.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Deja de preocuparte por tanta pendejada.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:07.04,0:35:09.50,中文,,0,0,0,,我不要再成天泡在实验室里了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.04,0:35:09.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No me pienso encerrar otra vez en ese laboratorio.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:12.04,0:35:13.58,中文,,0,0,0,,我要按自己的方式生活
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.04,0:35:13.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo voy a hacer mi propia vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:17.29,0:35:18.12,中文,,0,0,0,,冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.29,0:35:18.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tranquilo.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:25.25,0:35:28.17,中文,,0,0,0,,你何不直接把想做的事情告诉你爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.25,0:35:28.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Entonces, ¿por qué no le dices a tu papá qué quieres hacer?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.54,0:35:36.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.54,0:35:38.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo lo que quiero es estar contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:37.42,0:35:38.50,中文,,0,0,0,,就是和你在一起
Dialogue: 10,0:35:56.33,0:35:57.21,中文,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.33,0:35:57.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo también.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.33,0:36:12.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ríen]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.54,0:36:20.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suena música animada]
Dialogue: 10,0:36:22.79,0:36:25.75,中文,,0,0,0,,（美洲大陆首次惊艳亮相 魔毯）
Dialogue: 10,0:36:27.75,0:36:28.58,中文,,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.75,0:36:28.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Mira!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.88,0:36:36.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[niños gritan]
Dialogue: 10,0:36:42.12,0:36:45.50,中文,,0,0,0,,和跟你在一起的感受比起来那根本不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.12,0:36:45.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Eso no se compara con lo que siento yo cuando estamos juntos.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:51.21,0:36:52.54,中文,,0,0,0,,你现在是一个男人了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.21,0:36:52.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ahora sí eres un hombre.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:58.71,0:36:59.92,中文,,0,0,0,,你要当爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.71,0:36:59.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vas a tener un hijo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.00,0:37:06.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:37:18.67,0:37:22.58,中文,,0,0,0,,（演出）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.46,0:37:26.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:37:37.04,0:37:37.88,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.04,0:37:37.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué te pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:38.50,0:37:39.58,中文,,0,0,0,,没什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.50,0:37:39.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Nada!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:42.62,0:37:43.62,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.62,0:37:43.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:44.83,0:37:46.08,中文,,0,0,0,,别吵我睡觉！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.83,0:37:46.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Déjame dormir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.25,0:37:51.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[resopla]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.29,0:38:03.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio suspira]
Dialogue: 10,0:38:05.96,0:38:09.04,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥食不下咽 夜不成寐
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.96,0:38:09.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] perdió el apetito y el sueño.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:11.46,0:38:16.08,中文,,0,0,0,,对整个世界的怨恨咬噬着他的心那种滋味太过煎熬
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.46,0:38:16.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Fue tal su trastorno que, mordido por un virulento rencor contra el mundo,
Dialogue: 10,0:38:17.42,0:38:21.42,中文,,0,0,0,,以至于一天晚上他离开床榻 混迹入市集的喧嚣
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.42,0:38:18.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,una noche abandonó la cama
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.83,0:38:21.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para confundirse con el tumulto de la feria
Dialogue: 10,0:38:22.38,0:38:24.75,中文,,0,0,0,,想在那里寻得慰藉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.38,0:38:24.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y encontrar ahí algo de sosiego.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.83,0:38:26.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suena música animada]
Dialogue: 10,0:38:31.38,0:38:35.12,中文,,0,0,0,,在各种奇怪玩意之间徜徉许久之后
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.38,0:38:35.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] por entre toda la suerte de artificios,
Dialogue: 10,0:38:36.17,0:38:38.21,中文,,0,0,0,,他发现了一位年轻的吉普赛少女
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:38.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,se fijó en una gitana muy joven.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:39.25,0:38:41.92,中文,,0,0,0,,那是他平生见过的最美的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.25,0:38:41.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La mujer más bella que había visto en su vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:57.75,0:39:00.50,中文,,0,0,0,,初次接触时
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.75,0:39:00.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Al primer contacto, los huesos de la muchacha
Dialogue: 10,0:39:01.38,0:39:04.83,中文,,0,0,0,,少女的骨头宛如脱臼一般发出杂乱无章的脆响
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.38,0:39:04.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,parecieron desarticularse con un crujido desordenado,
Dialogue: 10,0:39:05.50,0:39:07.62,中文,,0,0,0,,就像一盒摇晃的多米诺骨牌
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.50,0:39:07.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- como el de un fichero de dominó. - [gime]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.21,0:39:09.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:39:12.08,0:39:13.79,中文,,0,0,0,,起床了 孩子们 醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.08,0:39:13.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ajá, niños. Levántense.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:16.88,0:39:17.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你哥哥呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.88,0:39:17.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y tu hermano?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:18.96,0:39:19.96,中文,,0,0,0,,他还没回来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.96,0:39:19.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No ha vuelto.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:34.38,0:39:35.21,中文,,0,0,0,,马蒂尔德！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.38,0:39:35.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Matilde!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:38.62,0:39:39.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你看见我儿子了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:39.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Has visto a mi hijo?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:41.75,0:39:42.71,中文,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.75,0:39:42.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.79,0:39:44.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La última vez que lo vi fue en tu casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:42.88,0:39:44.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我上次见他还是在你家
Dialogue: 10,0:39:44.83,0:39:46.25,中文,,0,0,0,,我们去问问皮拉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.83,0:39:46.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vamos a preguntarle a Pilar.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:53.83,0:39:54.67,中文,,0,0,0,,皮拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.83,0:39:54.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Pilar!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:57.04,0:39:58.54,中文,,0,0,0,,你见到何塞·阿卡蒂奥了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.04,0:39:58.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Has visto a José Arcadio?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:07.25,0:40:08.33,中文,,0,0,0,,卡塔里诺！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.25,0:40:08.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Catarino!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:12.42,0:40:15.00,中文,,0,0,0,,-卡塔里诺 你看见我儿子了吗？-你儿子？没有
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.42,0:40:15.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Catarino, ¿has visto a mi hijo? - ¿Tu hijo? Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.08,0:40:16.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo lo vi anoche con los gitanos.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:15.33,0:40:16.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我昨晚看到他和吉普赛人在一起
Dialogue: 10,0:40:46.46,0:40:47.67,中文,,0,0,0,,他变成吉普赛人了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.46,0:40:47.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Se metió de gitano.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:52.54,0:40:56.58,中文,,0,0,0,,去 回家去 通知你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.54,0:40:53.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Anda.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.75,0:40:56.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vete para la casa y le cuentas a tu papá.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.71,0:41:07.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:41:19.88,0:41:22.21,中文,,0,0,0,,几个小时后何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.88,0:41:22.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] José Arcadio Buendía
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.29,0:41:24.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,reunió a un grupo de hombres bien equipados.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:22.96,0:41:24.88,中文,,0,0,0,,召集了一群装备齐全的人
Dialogue: 10,0:41:42.38,0:41:47.00,中文,,0,0,0,,经过三天徒劳无功的搜索他们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.38,0:41:44.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Al cabo de tres días de búsqueda inútil,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.08,0:41:47.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,regresaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.71,0:41:56.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música dramática]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.21,0:42:26.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[tararea]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.50,0:42:36.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música dramática continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:42:45.79,0:42:47.25,中文,,0,0,0,,有好几个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.79,0:42:48.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] José Arcadio Buendía
Dialogue: 10,0:42:47.33,0:42:50.92,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚放任自己被惊惶吞没
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.58,0:42:50.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,se dejó vencer por la consternación.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.17,0:42:58.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Amaranta llora]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.67,0:43:02.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música cesa]
Dialogue: 10,0:43:22.25,0:43:24.67,中文,,0,0,0,,把银做成细丝会更好用
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.25,0:43:24.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La plata se trabaja mejor en filamentos.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:26.04,0:43:27.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.04,0:43:27.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ya vas a ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:36.83,0:43:38.25,中文,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.83,0:43:38.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:39.50,0:43:40.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你哥哥会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.50,0:43:40.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tu hermano va a volver.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:43.71,0:43:44.54,中文,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.71,0:43:44.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ven.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:45.67,0:43:46.71,中文,,0,0,0,,去拿锤子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.67,0:43:46.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Coge el martillo.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:52.04,0:43:54.25,中文,,0,0,0,,你得把它锤打成型
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.04,0:43:54.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hay que martillar la plata dándole forma.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:57.92,0:43:58.75,中文,,0,0,0,,从下面开始
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.92,0:43:58.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,De abajo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.67,0:44:23.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[tintineo]
Dialogue: 10,0:44:39.29,0:44:41.71,中文,,0,0,0,,时间会让一切恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.29,0:44:41.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] en su puesto.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:51.12,0:44:53.38,中文,,0,0,0,,爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.12,0:44:53.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Papá? ¡Papá!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:54.42,0:44:55.46,中文,,0,0,0,,快看篮子！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.42,0:44:55.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡La canasta!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:56.50,0:44:58.83,中文,,0,0,0,,-爸爸！-这都是物质的特性 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.50,0:44:58.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¡Papá! - Son propiedades de la materia, hijo.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:58.92,0:45:01.17,中文,,0,0,0,,没什么特别的只要明白其中的原理就好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.92,0:45:01.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Nada extraordinario si logras entender.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:06.08,0:45:07.50,中文,,0,0,0,,在那段闭门不出的时日里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.08,0:45:07.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:45:08.71,0:45:12.83,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚在内心深处殷殷乞盼的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.71,0:45:11.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía rogaba en el fondo de su corazón
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.88,0:45:15.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que el prodigio esperado no fuera convertir en oro los metales,
Dialogue: 10,0:45:12.92,0:45:15.50,中文,,0,0,0,,不是将金属炼成黄金
Dialogue: 10,0:45:16.88,0:45:18.58,中文,,0,0,0,,而是乌苏拉的回归
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.88,0:45:18.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,sino el regreso de Úrsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.50,0:45:31.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [canto de aves] - [bullicio]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.67,0:45:43.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[relincho]
Dialogue: 10,0:45:49.79,0:45:51.25,中文,,0,0,0,,爸爸！你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.79,0:45:51.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Papá! ¡Mira esto!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:01.62,0:46:03.83,中文,,0,0,0,,五个月后 乌苏拉回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.62,0:46:03.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] volvió Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:03.92,0:46:05.79,中文,,0,0,0,,是你妈妈！快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.92,0:46:05.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Tu mamá! ¡Anda!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.88,0:46:07.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] de la ciénaga,
Dialogue: 10,0:46:06.04,0:46:07.75,中文,,0,0,0,,她自大沼泽地的另一边来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.83,0:46:11.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,donde había pueblos que recibían el correo todos los meses
Dialogue: 10,0:46:08.46,0:46:11.33,中文,,0,0,0,,那里有每个月都会收到邮件的城镇
Dialogue: 10,0:46:11.88,0:46:14.21,中文,,0,0,0,,那里的人会熟练使用改善生活的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.88,0:46:14.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y conocían las máquinas del bienestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.58,0:46:20.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música melancólica]
Dialogue: 10,0:46:23.17,0:46:24.25,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.17,0:46:24.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y José Arcadio?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:29.08,0:46:30.92,中文,,0,0,0,,我没找到那些吉普赛人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.08,0:46:30.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Nunca logré encontrar a los gitanos.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:32.71,0:46:34.21,中文,,0,0,0,,也没有人知道他的事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.71,0:46:34.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y nadie me dio razón de él.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:59.17,0:47:00.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 10,0:47:01.96,0:47:02.92,中文,,0,0,0,,她真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.96,0:47:02.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Qué linda.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:14.75,0:47:16.46,中文,,0,0,0,,这些是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.75,0:47:16.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B.] ¿Y toda esta gente?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:22.08,0:47:24.88,中文,,0,0,0,,他们都想来看大沼泽地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.08,0:47:24.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Todos querían conocer la maravilla de este pueblo
Dialogue: 10,0:47:25.38,0:47:26.75,中文,,0,0,0,,奇迹小镇
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.38,0:47:26.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en la mitad de la ciénaga.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:28.33,0:47:29.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.33,0:47:29.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Lo lograste.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:30.29,0:47:33.04,中文,,0,0,0,,你找到了让马孔多和这个世界相联系的渠道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.29,0:47:33.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Encontraste los caminos que unen a Macondo con el mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:38.46,0:47:40.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我想介绍比希塔森和卡陶雷给你认识
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.46,0:47:40.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Te quiero presentar a Visitación y Cataure.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:42.08,0:47:43.96,中文,,0,0,0,,这一路上都是他们陪着我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.08,0:47:43.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me acompañaron durante el viaje.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:44.71,0:47:46.04,中文,,0,0,0,,他们今后就跟我们一起住了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.71,0:47:46.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Van a vivir con nosotros.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:51.29,0:47:52.25,中文,,0,0,0,,欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.29,0:47:52.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Bienvenido.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:52.33,0:47:53.67,中文,,0,0,0,,先生 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.33,0:47:53.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en wayú] Señor, ¿qué tal?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:57.62,0:47:58.92,中文,,0,0,0,,您好 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.62,0:47:59.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Cómo está, señor? - [en español] Bienvenida.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:59.00,0:47:59.96,中文,,0,0,0,,欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.21,0:48:07.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:48:12.00,0:48:13.04,中文,,0,0,0,,当心
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.00,0:48:13.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Con cuidado.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:06.92,0:49:08.21,中文,,0,0,0,,别再离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.92,0:49:08.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No te vuelvas a ir.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:10.54,0:49:11.54,中文,,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.54,0:49:11.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tú tampoco.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.12,0:49:17.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [tocan la puerta] - [perros ladran]
Dialogue: 10,0:49:21.29,0:49:22.17,中文,,0,0,0,,皮拉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.29,0:49:22.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pilar.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:26.08,0:49:27.38,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.08,0:49:27.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué haces aquí?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.08,0:49:31.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[bebé llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:49:34.29,0:49:35.38,中文,,0,0,0,,这是谁的孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.29,0:49:35.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y esa criatura?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:37.33,0:49:38.21,中文,,0,0,0,,是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.33,0:49:38.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es mía.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:39.75,0:49:40.79,中文,,0,0,0,,是一个小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.75,0:49:40.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es un varoncito.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:41.42,0:49:42.67,中文,,0,0,0,,孩子的父亲是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.42,0:49:42.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y el papá?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:45.88,0:49:47.08,中文,,0,0,0,,何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.88,0:49:47.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:48.79,0:49:50.29,中文,,0,0,0,,我来把他交给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.79,0:49:50.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Por eso vine a entregártelo.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:51.29,0:49:52.92,中文,,0,0,0,,你是在开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.29,0:49:52.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué barbaridad estás diciendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:56.83,0:49:58.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我们相爱了 乌苏拉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.83,0:49:58.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Nos enamoramos, Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:00.12,0:50:01.25,中文,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.12,0:50:01.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Eso no puede ser.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:02.88,0:50:04.00,中文,,0,0,0,,但那是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.88,0:50:04.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Pero fue. - [bebé llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:50:04.50,0:50:05.62,中文,,0,0,0,,好了 不哭了 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.50,0:50:05.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ya, mi amor. Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:06.71,0:50:07.62,中文,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.71,0:50:07.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Fuiste tú.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:09.25,0:50:11.42,中文,,0,0,0,,是你害我儿子失踪的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.25,0:50:11.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡La que hizo que mi hijo desapareciera!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:14.75,0:50:17.79,中文,,0,0,0,,既然你用巫术操纵他造出了这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.75,0:50:17.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Si lo enredaste con tu brujería y creaste ese niño…
Dialogue: 10,0:50:19.92,0:50:21.38,中文,,0,0,0,,就自己抚养这野种吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.92,0:50:21.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,cría ese bastardo tú sola.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.88,0:50:23.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:50:24.42,0:50:25.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.42,0:50:26.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Míralo. - [bebé llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:50:26.50,0:50:27.38,中文,,0,0,0,,看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.50,0:50:27.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Míralo.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:28.67,0:50:30.50,中文,,0,0,0,,看呀 乌苏拉 他是你的血脉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.67,0:50:30.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Míralo, Úrsula. Es tu sangre.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.75,0:50:36.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [bebé llora] - [Pilar] Shh…
Dialogue: 10,0:50:39.62,0:50:41.29,中文,,0,0,0,,他长得很像我们的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.62,0:50:41.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tiene la cara de nuestros padres.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:41.79,0:50:43.25,中文,,0,0,0,,好了 不哭…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.79,0:50:45.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Ya, mi amor. Shh… - [bebé llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:50:45.29,0:50:48.12,中文,,0,0,0,,既然是布恩迪亚家的人就该在自己家里长大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.29,0:50:48.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Si es un Buendía, tiene que crecer con su familia.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:48.21,0:50:49.71,中文,,0,0,0,,好吧 我会收留这孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.21,0:50:49.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tú quieres, recibo a ese niño.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:51.42,0:50:54.04,中文,,0,0,0,,只要那娼妇再也不踏进这个家门
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.42,0:50:54.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Entonces, esta puta no vuelve a poner un pie en esta casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:55.29,0:50:57.29,中文,,0,0,0,,那孩子也不能知道他的生母是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.29,0:50:57.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y ese niño no va a saber quién lo parió,
Dialogue: 10,0:50:57.38,0:51:00.21,中文,,0,0,0,,因为她的所作所为令这个家族蒙羞
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.38,0:51:00.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,porque lo que ella hizo es una vergüenza para esta familia.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:03.42,0:51:05.21,中文,,0,0,0,,这就是我们的条件 皮拉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.42,0:51:05.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Esas son las condiciones, Pilar.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:09.96,0:51:11.21,中文,,0,0,0,,他在这里会过得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.96,0:51:11.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Él va a estar mejor aquí.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.67,0:51:14.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[bebé llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:51:27.88,0:51:30.50,中文,,0,0,0,,孩子被命名为何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.88,0:51:30.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] el nombre de José Arcadio,
Dialogue: 10,0:51:31.50,0:51:34.33,中文,,0,0,0,,但为防混淆 他们直接叫他阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.50,0:51:34.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero lo llamaron Arcadio para evitar confusiones.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.79,0:51:41.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:51:52.67,0:51:56.67,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺无休止地埋头在实验室里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.67,0:51:56.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] horas interminables en el laboratorio,
Dialogue: 10,0:51:57.42,0:52:00.92,中文,,0,0,0,,在一次次独立实验中钻研着银器工艺
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.42,0:52:00.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,aprendiendo por pura investigación el arte de la platería.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:07.71,0:52:10.54,中文,,0,0,0,,青春期带走了他软糯的声线
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.71,0:52:10.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La adolescencia le quitó la dulzura de la voz.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:11.46,0:52:13.33,中文,,0,0,0,,他变得沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.46,0:52:13.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Lo volvió silencioso
Dialogue: 10,0:52:14.21,0:52:16.38,中文,,0,0,0,,而且孤独入骨
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.21,0:52:16.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y definitivamente solitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.46,0:52:18.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[crujido]
Dialogue: 10,0:52:19.54,0:52:24.38,中文,,0,0,0,,但他也得以重拾了出生时那灼然如炬的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.54,0:52:22.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] le restituyó la expresión intensa
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.46,0:52:24.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que tuvo en los ojos al nacer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.79,0:52:33.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[crujido continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:52:35.21,0:52:37.04,中文,,0,0,0,,一起来玩吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.21,0:52:37.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Arcadio en wayú] ¡Vamos a jugar!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:37.58,0:52:38.54,中文,,0,0,0,,来呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.58,0:52:38.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Amaranta] ¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:39.17,0:52:40.42,中文,,0,0,0,,去躲起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.17,0:52:40.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Arcadio] ¡Escóndete!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:41.17,0:52:42.38,中文,,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.17,0:52:42.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Amaranta] ¿Qué es eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:43.25,0:52:44.17,中文,,0,0,0,,跑呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.25,0:52:44.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Arcadio] ¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.71,0:52:49.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[crujido continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:53:00.12,0:53:01.21,中文,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.12,0:53:01.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:03.50,0:53:04.79,中文,,0,0,0,,是什么嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.50,0:53:04.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Amaranta] ¿Qué es eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:06.92,0:53:08.21,中文,,0,0,0,,-跑呀！-快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.92,0:53:08.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¡Vamos! - ¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:09.75,0:53:10.75,中文,,0,0,0,,跑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.75,0:53:10.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:11.67,0:53:12.67,中文,,0,0,0,,去藏起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.67,0:53:12.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Escóndete!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:15.08,0:53:15.96,中文,,0,0,0,,跑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.08,0:53:15.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:16.50,0:53:17.67,中文,,0,0,0,,到底是什么嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.50,0:53:17.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué es eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:21.58,0:53:22.79,中文,,0,0,0,,阿卡蒂奥、阿玛兰妲！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.58,0:53:25.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] ¡Arcadio, Amaranta! Dejen de estar hablando en wayuunaiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:23.29,0:53:24.92,中文,,0,0,0,,别再说瓦尤语了
Dialogue: 10,0:53:25.42,0:53:27.38,中文,,0,0,0,,我不是让你们说西班牙语吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.42,0:53:27.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Les he dicho que hablen en español.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.46,0:53:29.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ventisca]
Dialogue: 10,0:53:29.92,0:53:30.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.92,0:53:30.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y a ti qué te pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:35.00,0:53:36.04,中文,,0,0,0,,有人要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.00,0:53:36.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Alguien va a venir.
